  "text": {
    "markdown": "## Booking a table at Luigi's Trattoria\n\nHappy to book it. I need a few details first:\n\n1. **Date** — which evening?\n2. **Time** — they take dinner reservations every 30 minutes from 17:30 to 21:30:\n   `17:30` · `18:00` · `18:30` · `19:00` · `19:30` · `20:00` · `20:30` · `21:00` · `21:30`\n3. **Party size** — 1 to 8 people.\n4. **Seating** — indoors or on the terrace?\n5. **Name** for the reservation, and a **phone number** in case the restaurant needs to reach you.\n6. Anything they should know? (allergies, a high chair, a birthday…)\n\nYou can copy this, fill it in and send it back:\n\n```\nDate:\nTime:\nPeople:\nSeating: indoors / terrace\nName:\nPhone:\nNotes:\n```\n\nFor example: *\"Saturday, 19:30, 4 people, terrace, under Rossi, 555 0142, one vegetarian.\"*\n\n**Good to know**\n\n- Reservations go up to 8 people. For a larger group you would need to contact the restaurant directly.\n- If you choose the terrace, tell me whether an indoor table is an acceptable fallback.\n- A second-choice time helps in case your first slot is taken.\n\nOnce I have these I will make the request and confirm the details back to you.\n",
